DESCRIPTION:Interwoven Expressions - celebrating 41 years of juried textil
 e and fiber arts. Fiber in the hands of weavers\, dyers\, felters\, hooker
 s\, seamstresses\, and basketweavers. All original works by hand. Particip
 ation limited to residents of states bordering our Lake Michigan. Currentl
 y featuring artists from Grand Rapids to Lafayette\, Kalamazoo to South Be
 nd\, to Chicago and points between. Exquisite creations - contemporary and
  traditional - fashion\, home décor\, and holiday gifts. Excellent holida
 y shopping. Shop early for best selection. Our loyal following begin their
  holiday shopping when the doors open! Free admission\, free parking. Make
  it a girl’s day out! Shop\, dine with a glass of wine at the lovely San
 d Creek Grill Room and then shop again for those treasures that you forgot
 ! Join us! Chesterton is an art-filled community. Art everywhere. Spend th
 e day!
