DESCRIPTION:✈️🚆 PLANES\, TRAINS &amp\; AUTOMOBILES 🚗💨Saturday
 \, November 21 at 7:00 PMJust $5! And yes… we now accept CASH! 💵Somet
 imes getting home for Thanksgiving is half the adventure!Before travel app
 s\, GPS\, and flight-delay notifications\, there was Neal Page and Del Gri
 ffith—and one very long\, very funny trip home!Steve Martin and John Can
 dy star in this beloved Thanksgiving classic about two complete opposites 
 who are thrown together when a series of travel disasters turns Neal’s s
 imple trip home into an unforgettable adventure. Missed flights\, wrong tu
 rns\, trains\, rental cars\, motel mishaps—and one very persistent trave
 ling companion—make this holiday journey anything but smooth!❤️ Fun
 ny\, nostalgic\, and filled with heart\, Planes\, Trains &amp\; Automobil
 es is the kind of movie that brings back memories and gets funnier every 
 time you watch it.So gather your family\, grab your friends\, and leave th
 e holiday travel stress at home. For just $5\, come enjoy the ride with u
 s at the MET!📅 Saturday\, November 21🕖 7:00 PM🎟️ Tickets jus
 t $5!💵 Cash or cards accepted (service fees apply)!Come laugh\, remini
 sce\, and kick off the Thanksgiving season with a true comedy classic!Movi
 e: Planes\, Trains\, &amp\; AutomobilesShow Time: Saturday\, November 21 a
 t 7:00 PMRun Time: 1 hour 35 minutesRating: RBox Office opens one hour bef
 ore shows for in person sales. ACCESSIBILITY INFORMATIONWhen selecting you
 r seats for non-general admission shows\, please be aware that balcony acc
 ess is via stairs only. Wheelchair-accessible seating is available for gue
 sts who use wheelchairs. There is no seat in wheelchair-accessible seating
 .CONCESSIONS ARE AVAILABLEPlease do not bring any outside food\, beverages
  or drink containers. Concessions open one hour before the start of every 
 show.WHAT IS YOUR REFUND POLICY?All sales are final. We do not offer excha
 nges for other movies or performances. Tickets can be forwarded to friends
  and family.WILL THE MET CANCEL SHOWS FOR BAD WEATHER?In the interest of p
 ublic safety\, shows may be postponed. Every effort will be made to resche
 dule instead of cancel.WHAT ELSE SHOULD I KNOW BEFORE ENJOYING A SHOW AT T
 HE MET?The MET accepts cash\, credit\, and debit cards.
